    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\tYukari and StEVEN returned from the inspection of synthfarms. Bad
        news - revaporators are heavily damaged. We'll need a lot of time to make
        them operational again.\n\r\n\tIt means we have a food problem. Rations we
        took with us from our home planet will not last long, and we have to eat
        something. Well, maybe except StEVEN and Yukari - they just need to charge.
        Good for them.\n\r\n\tI wish I could help in some way. I'm so useless - everyone
        in the colony has some important skills, meanwhile I just know how to cut
        someone's hair or paint their nails. Veeery handy during the world crisis."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 15.6
